{"schema":2,"shard":6,"views":{"dailyreports":"\n    <div class=\"ops-head\">\n      <div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Today’s operations</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 6px\">Daily reports</h2><div class=\"muted\">See whether reports arrived, what needs management follow-up and how locations are performing. Reporting data supports management review; it is not an automatic employee-rating system.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"ops-filters\"><div><label for=\"opsReportDate\">Date</label><input id=\"opsReportDate\" type=\"date\" data-bw-onchange=\"renderDailyOperations()\"></div><div><label for=\"opsLocationFilter\">Location</label><select id=\"opsLocationFilter\" data-bw-onchange=\"renderDailyOperations()\"><option value=\"\">All locations</option></select></div><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"renderDailyOperations()\">Refresh</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"generateOpsSummary()\">Generate summary</button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ops-kpi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"card ops-stat\"><div class=\"ops-stat-copy\"><div class=\"kpi\">Reporting coverage</div><div id=\"opsCoverage\" class=\"score\">0%</div><div class=\"muted small\">Reports received ÷ active reporting links</div></div><div class=\"metric-ring ring-green\" data-ring-target=\"opsCoverage\" style=\"width:94px;height:94px\" aria-label=\"Daily reporting coverage\"><div class=\"metric-ring-core\"><span>today</span></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card ops-stat\"><div class=\"ops-stat-copy\"><div class=\"kpi\">Reports received</div><div id=\"opsReportsReceived\" class=\"score\">0</div><div class=\"muted small\"><span id=\"opsExpectedReports\">0</span> expected reporting links</div></div><div class=\"metric-orb\" style=\"width:94px;height:94px\"><div id=\"opsReportOrb\" class=\"score\">0</div><span>reports</span></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card ops-stat\"><div class=\"ops-stat-copy\"><div class=\"kpi\">Locations reporting</div><div id=\"opsLocationsReporting\" class=\"score\">0</div><div class=\"muted small\">Locations with at least one report</div></div><div class=\"metric-orb\" style=\"width:94px;height:94px\"><div id=\"opsLocationOrb\" class=\"score\">0</div><span>sites</span></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card ops-stat\"><div class=\"ops-stat-copy\"><div class=\"kpi\">Needs follow-up</div><div id=\"opsAttention\" class=\"score warn\">0</div><div class=\"muted small\">Employee-raised manager flags</div></div><div class=\"metric-orb\" style=\"width:94px;height:94px\"><div id=\"opsAttentionOrb\" class=\"score\">0</div><span>flags</span></div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ops-primary-grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Management summary</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 0\">What happened today</h2></div><span id=\"opsSummaryMode\" class=\"badge\">Not generated</span></div><div id=\"opsAiSummary\" class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Generate a summary after reports start arriving. Numeric performance metrics remain system-calculated; AI is used for narrative synthesis only.</div><div id=\"opsSummaryFeedback\" class=\"ops-feedback-row\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"muted small\">Was this useful?</span><button class=\"btn soft\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"sendOpsSummaryFeedback('useful')\">Useful</button><button class=\"btn soft\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"sendOpsSummaryFeedback('not_useful')\">Not useful</button><span id=\"opsFeedbackStatus\" class=\"muted small\"></span></div><div class=\"ops-safe-note\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><b>Decision guardrail</b><br>AI summaries are management aids. They cannot automatically rank staff, determine misconduct or justify discipline. Review source reports and relevant context first.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card ops-followup-card\"><div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Follow-up</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 0\">Reports not received</h2></div><span id=\"opsMissingCount\" class=\"badge\">0</span></div><div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:6px 0 10px\">A reporting gap is not proof of absence or poor performance. Confirm leave, rest days, field assignments and connectivity before follow-up.</div><div id=\"opsMissingReports\"></div><div id=\"opsReportingExceptionsWrap\" style=\"margin-top:14px;display:none\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Not expected today</div><div id=\"opsReportingExceptions\" style=\"margin-top:7px\"></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Location roll-up</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 0\">Reporting & output by location</h2></div><span class=\"badge\">Factual roll-up</span></div><div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Shows reporting coverage and submitted operational KPIs. Trends compare with the previous reporting day; they are not employee appraisal scores.</div><div id=\"opsBranchPerformance\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"></div><details class=\"ops-source-details\"><summary>View submitted source reports</summary><div id=\"opsReportsList\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div></details></div>\n\n    <details id=\"opsIntelligenceDetails\" class=\"ops-specialist-details\">\n      <summary data-bw-onclick=\"loadOpsPerformanceLearning()\">Performance learning & alerts <span class=\"muted small\">Advanced management signals · loads on demand</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"ops-specialist-inner\">\n        <div class=\"grid g2 ops-intelligence-grid\">\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">AI learning</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 0\">Performance memory</h2></div><span id=\"opsLearningStatus\" class=\"badge\">Learning</span></div>\n            <div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Learns from branch operating history, recurring report themes and manager feedback. It does not retrain the base model or build hidden employee scores.</div>\n            <div id=\"opsLearningMetrics\" class=\"ops-learning-metrics\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"></div><div id=\"opsLearningThemes\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n            <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"refreshOpsPerformanceLearning()\">Refresh learning</button><span id=\"opsLearningUpdated\" class=\"muted small\"></span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Performance notifications</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 0\">Signals & alerts</h2></div><span id=\"opsAlertCount\" class=\"badge\">0 open</span></div>\n            <div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Alerts are driven by measured thresholds and repeated patterns. AI explains the signal; it does not decide whether an employee performed poorly.</div><div id=\"opsPerformanceAlerts\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n            <details class=\"ops-settings-panel\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><summary>Alert settings</summary><div class=\"ops-settings-grid\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n              <label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfEnabled\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Operations perf enabled\"> Enable performance learning alerts</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfDeterioration\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Operations perf deterioration\"> Notify meaningful deterioration</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfImprovement\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Operations perf improvement\"> Notify meaningful improvement</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfCoverage\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Operations perf coverage\"> Notify reporting-coverage drops</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfIncidents\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Operations perf incidents\"> Notify incident signals</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfInApp\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Operations perf in app\"> In-app notifications</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfEmail\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Operations perf email\"> Email alerts when configured</label><label class=\"checkline\"><input id=\"opsPerfWhatsapp\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Operations perf WhatsApp\"> WhatsApp alerts when connected and consented</label>\n              <div><label for=\"opsPerfCoverageDrop\">Coverage drop</label><input id=\"opsPerfCoverageDrop\" type=\"number\" min=\"5\" max=\"60\" value=\"20\"><div class=\"muted small\">percentage points below learned baseline</div></div><div><label for=\"opsPerfMetricDrop\">Output drop</label><input id=\"opsPerfMetricDrop\" type=\"number\" min=\"10\" max=\"70\" value=\"30\"><div class=\"muted small\">percent below learned baseline</div></div><div><label for=\"opsPerfImprovementPct\">Improvement</label><input id=\"opsPerfImprovementPct\" type=\"number\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"25\"><div class=\"muted small\">percent above learned baseline</div></div><div><label for=\"opsPerfMinDays\">Minimum history</label><input id=\"opsPerfMinDays\" type=\"number\" min=\"2\" max=\"30\" value=\"3\"><div class=\"muted small\">reporting days before trend alerts</div></div>\n            </div><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" style=\"margin-top:12px\" data-bw-onclick=\"saveOpsPerformanceSettings()\">Save performance alerts</button><span id=\"opsPerformanceSettingsStatus\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-left:8px\"></span></details>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details id=\"opsReportingSetupDetails\" class=\"ops-specialist-details\">\n      <summary>Reporting setup <span class=\"muted small\">Locations, employee links and automation</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"ops-specialist-inner\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Automation</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 10px\">Daily leadership digest</h2><div class=\"ops-setting-row\"><div><b>Auto-generate at 18:15 Botswana time</b><div class=\"muted small\">Creates a daily summary and in-app notification. Uses Workers AI credits when available; otherwise produces a structured factual roll-up.</div></div><input id=\"opsAutoSummary\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Ops auto summary\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-bw-onclick=\"saveOpsReportingSettings()\">Save automation</button><div id=\"opsAutomationStatus\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n          <div class=\"card\"><h2>Locations</h2><div class=\"muted small\">Create the offices, branches, shops, sites or teams you want to track separately.</div><div class=\"formgrid\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><div><label for=\"opsLocationName\">Location name</label><input id=\"opsLocationName\" placeholder=\"e.g. Gaborone Main Office\"></div><div><label for=\"opsLocationCode\">Code</label><input id=\"opsLocationCode\" maxlength=\"16\" placeholder=\"GBE\"></div><div><label for=\"opsLocationTown\">Town / area</label><input id=\"opsLocationTown\" placeholder=\"Gaborone\"></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:10px\" data-bw-onclick=\"addOpsLocation()\">Add location</button><div id=\"opsLocationsList\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"card\"><h2>Employee reporting access</h2><div class=\"muted small\">Issue a restricted reporting link. The link can submit daily reports only; it does not open the compliance workspace.</div><div class=\"formgrid\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><div><label for=\"opsReporterEmployee\">Employee</label><select id=\"opsReporterEmployee\"></select></div><div><label for=\"opsReporterLocation\">Location</label><select id=\"opsReporterLocation\"></select></div><div><label for=\"opsReporterExpiry\">Link expires</label><select id=\"opsReporterExpiry\"><option value=\"90\">90 days</option><option value=\"180\" selected>180 days</option><option value=\"365\">365 days</option></select></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:10px\" data-bw-onclick=\"createOpsReporterLink()\">Create / rotate reporting link</button><div id=\"opsReporterLinkResult\"></div><div id=\"opsReporterAccessList\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  ","manufacturing":"\n    <div class=\"grid g3\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Manufacturing applicability</div><div id=\"mfgApplicability\" class=\"score\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Processing route</div><div id=\"mfgRoute\" style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Reserved-activity risk</div><div id=\"mfgReserved\" style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><h2>Industrial compliance path</h2><div id=\"mfgChecklist\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Manufacturing profile</h2>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <div><label for=\"mfgActivity\">Manufacturing activity</label><select id=\"mfgActivity\">\n            <option value=\"\">Select activity</option>\n            <option>School uniforms</option><option>School furniture</option><option>Burglar bars</option><option>Protective clothing</option>\n            <option>Sorghum milling</option><option>Cement bricks</option><option>Bread and confectionery</option><option>Peanut butter</option>\n            <option>Bottled water</option><option>Traditional sour milk</option><option>Packaging</option><option>Floor polish</option>\n            <option>Traditional leather products</option><option>Traditional crafts</option><option>Signage</option><option>Fencing materials</option>\n            <option>Candles</option><option>Ice making</option><option>Meat processing</option><option>Other manufacturing</option>\n          </select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"mfgFactory\">Factory/premises operation?</label><select id=\"mfgFactory\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No / uncertain</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"mfgAnniversary\">Industrial licence first-issue / renewal anniversary</label><input id=\"mfgAnniversary\" type=\"date\"></div>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"saveManufacturingProfile()\">Save manufacturing profile</button>\n          <div class=\"muted small\">Manufacturing requirements can include industrial licensing, environmental/health/planning approvals, premises proof, waste arrangements and factory registration depending on the activity and premises.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ","taxprofile":"\n    <div class=\"action-focus\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Next tax action</div>\n      <h2 id=\"taxNextTitle\">Review tax setup</h2>\n      <div id=\"taxNextDetail\" class=\"muted next-action-note\">Confirm only the facts the business already knows. Threshold conflicts stay review-gated.</div>\n      <div id=\"taxNextActions\" class=\"actions\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">PAYE</div><div id=\"taxPayeStatus\" style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">VAT</div><div id=\"taxVatCycle\" style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Open source conflicts</div><div id=\"taxConflictCount\" class=\"score bad\">0</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <details class=\"profile-details tax-source-details\" id=\"taxFactDetails\">\n      <summary><span><b>Tax facts & source evidence</b><small>Open when you need to confirm a VAT/PAYE fact or inspect why an automated conclusion is blocked.</small></span></summary>\n      <div class=\"profile-details-body\">\n        <div class=\"grid g2 tax-fact-grid\">\n          <div class=\"card\" id=\"taxVatFactsCard\">\n            <h3>VAT facts</h3>\n            <div class=\"stack\">\n              <div><label for=\"taxVatCategoryInput\">Confirmed VAT category / code</label><input id=\"taxVatCategoryInput\" placeholder=\"Enter only if confirmed\"></div>\n              <div><label for=\"taxAnnualTaxableSuppliesInput\">Annual taxable supplies (P)</label><input id=\"taxAnnualTaxableSuppliesInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1000\" placeholder=\"Optional supporting fact\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card\" id=\"taxPayeFactsCard\">\n            <h3>PAYE context</h3>\n            <div class=\"stack\">\n              <div><label for=\"taxHighestMonthlyPayInput\">Highest monthly employee pay (P)</label><input id=\"taxHighestMonthlyPayInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"100\" placeholder=\"Optional supporting fact\"></div>\n              <div class=\"muted small\">This fact is context only. Conflicting public threshold guidance remains review-gated and is not used to auto-register the taxpayer.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"saveTaxFacts()\">Save confirmed tax facts</button><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('profile')\">Update VAT/PAYE applicability</button><span id=\"taxSaveStatus\" class=\"muted small\" role=\"status\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><b>Control rule:</b> VAT registration is never inferred solely from annual turnover. Taxable supplies and payroll amounts are supporting facts only while authoritative BURS threshold guidance remains conflicted.</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><h3>Current tax summary</h3><div id=\"taxProfileSummary\"></div></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><h3>Source conflicts & validation</h3><div id=\"taxConflicts\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  ","aicontrols":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Credits used this month</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"aiMonthCredits\">—</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Provider cost</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"aiMonthCost\">—</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Credit cap</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"aiCreditCap\">—</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Cost cap</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"aiCostCap\">—</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>AI cost controls</h2>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <div><label for=\"aiMonthlyCreditCapInput\">Monthly credit cap</label><input id=\"aiMonthlyCreditCapInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"No cap\"></div>\n        <div><label for=\"aiMonthlyCostCapInput\">Monthly provider-cost cap (P)</label><input id=\"aiMonthlyCostCapInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"No cap\"></div>\n        <div><label for=\"aiLowBalanceInput\">Low-balance warning</label><input id=\"aiLowBalanceInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" value=\"25\"></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"saveAiCostControls()\">Save cost controls</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Margin protection</h2>\n      <div class=\"checkline\"><span class=\"dot good\"></span><div><b>Server-side hard stop</b><div class=\"muted small\">AI cannot run after the configured monthly credit or cost cap is reached.</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"checkline\"><span class=\"dot good\"></span><div><b>Provider-cost reconciliation</b><div class=\"muted small\">Actual provider spend is recorded separately from customer credits.</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"checkline\"><span class=\"dot good\"></span><div><b>Partner pooled credits</b><div class=\"muted small\">Client companies can consume an allocated partner pool after their own wallet is exhausted.</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n","inspectionreadiness":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Latest readiness</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"inspectionReadinessScore\">—</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Critical findings</div><div class=\"score bad\" id=\"inspectionCritical\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">High findings</div><div class=\"score warn\" id=\"inspectionHigh\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Packs</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"inspectionPackCount\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Challenge the business before somebody else does</div>\n      <h2>Inspection & Due-Diligence Simulator</h2>\n      <div class=\"notice\"><b>Readiness score, not enforcement probability.</b><div class=\"small\">The simulator tests the records already in this workspace against scenario-specific controls, obligations, evidence gaps and risk events. It is not an official regulator checklist and does not predict penalties, liability or tender outcomes.</div></div>\n      <div id=\"inspectionScenarioList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No scenarios available.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Latest simulation</h2>\n      <div id=\"inspectionSimulationDetail\" class=\"muted small\">Run a scenario to see readiness gaps.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Inspection packs</h2>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"exportLatestInspectionPack()\">Export latest pack</button>\n      <div id=\"inspectionPackList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No packs yet.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Recent simulations</h2><div id=\"inspectionSimulationList\" class=\"muted small\">No simulations yet.</div></div>\n  </div>\n","auditintegrity":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Ledger status</div><div class=\"score\" style=\"font-size:24px\" id=\"auditIntegrityStatus\">—</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Sealed events</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"auditSealedCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Legacy/unsealed</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"auditLegacyCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Write failures</div><div class=\"score bad\" id=\"auditFailureCount\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Defensible history</div><h2>Audit Integrity</h2></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"verifyAuditIntegrity()\">Verify chain</button></div>\n    <div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>New audit events are server-authored and hash-chained.</b><div class=\"small\">Pre-v56 records are explicitly identified as legacy/unsealed. The browser can no longer manufacture authoritative audit entries.</div></div>\n    <div id=\"auditIntegrityDetail\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n  </div>\n","regulatorygovernance":"<div class=\"grid g4\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Platform role</div><div class=\"score\" style=\"font-size:23px\" id=\"platformRegRole\">—</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Pending sources</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"platformRegPendingSources\">0</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Rules in review</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"platformRegReviewRules\">0</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Queued rollouts</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"platformRegQueuedRollouts\">0</div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Platform-only legal control plane</div><h2>Regulatory Governance</h2><div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><button id=\"foundationPackImportBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"importFoundationPack()\">Import Botswana Foundation Pack</button><span id=\"foundationPackStatus\" class=\"badge\">Not checked</span></div>\n    <div id=\"platformRegReadiness\" class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><b>Checking publishing readiness…</b></div><div class=\"notice\"><b>Tenant owners cannot publish global law.</b><div class=\"small\">Sources require verified content snapshots. A different platform reviewer must approve an editor's source or rule. Publishing queues tenant impact evaluation in bounded batches; it never performs a silent synchronous global rollout.</div></div><div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div><h3>Source queue</h3><div id=\"platformRegSourceList\" class=\"muted small\"></div></div><div><h3>Rule queue</h3><div id=\"platformRegRuleList\" class=\"muted small\"></div></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div><h3>Open conflicts</h3><div id=\"platformRegConflictList\" class=\"muted small\"></div></div><div><h3>Rollouts</h3><div id=\"platformRegRolloutList\" class=\"muted small\"></div></div></div></div>"}}